# Your first Passport API key, used only while setting up.
#
# Create it in the Passport app under Account -> API keys, as a team admin.
# Paste it after the = sign below (no quotes, no spaces) and save the file.
#
# Keeping an API key in a file like this isn't safe: any program running as
# you, including your agent, can read it. That's the exact problem Passport
# solves. In the hands-on step you'll move a new key into HashiCorp Vault,
# revoke this one, and this file gets deleted.
PASSPORT_API_KEY=
